### CF-3300 writes MV2.BAS from TXTTAB=$C001, line 10 holds 256 ($1C $00 $01)
   |  SAVE"MV2.BAS"
   |  Ok
   |  color auto  goto  list  run
### National_CF-3300 loads it
   |  10 A%=256:B%=&H100:PRINT A%;B
   |  %
   |  20 PRINT "TWO"
   |  Ok
   |  RUN
   |   256  256
   |  TWO
   |  Ok
   |  color auto  goto  list  run
### C-BIOS_MSX1_EU_REPACK_DISK loads it
   |   C#  @  F:|      G  C###s#r :  D 0A
   |      F   L  T        F    I     ~  I
   |  . ;   E;:     w   #"LOR.
   |  49920 -EQVy
   |  32192 u tBASE INSTRMAX(ERLMAX$0LINE w
   |   ASEMAX>.;<=16E-480MAXTAB(9 w AX<.=14
   |  18E-48MAX50PRESET37MAX 1LINE w ASEMAX
   |  RENUM2*CLOADANDMAX$0LINE w ASE ~
   |  65535
